      "translations": {
        "en.hubeali": [
          "Al Husayn Bin Muhammad, from Moalla Bin Muhammad, from Ahmad Bin Muhammad Bin Abdullah who said, ",
          "‘Al-Reza<sup>asws</sup> said to me: ‘Whenever you marry, so marry a (woman with) large buttocks’."
        ],
        "en.sarwar": [
          "3. Al-Husayn from Muhammad has narrated from Mu’alla’ ibn Muhammad from Ahmad ibn Muhammad from ibn ‘Abd Allah who has said the following: “Al-Rida’, ‘Alayhi al-Salam, once said to me, ‘If you want to marry, marry a woman of large buttocks.’” "
        ]
      }
